    <h2>Our Mission</h2>
    <p>AI is transforming forex trading — but the market is flooded with hype, scams, and fake "AI" signal providers. Our mission is simple: <strong>separate real AI trading tools from marketing noise.</strong></p>
    <p>We provide retail forex traders with objective, data-driven reviews of AI-powered signal services and trading strategies. No affiliate BS, no pay-to-play rankings — just verified performance data and honest verdicts.</p>

    <h2>Why We Exist</h2>
    <p>The AI forex signal review space is <strong>completely empty</strong>. Existing review sites cover:</p>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>Manual signals</strong> (HowToTrade, ForexCrunch) — human analysts, no AI</li>
      <li><strong>EA products</strong> (ForexRobotNation) — expert advisors, not AI/ML strategies</li>
      <li><strong>Education</strong> (BabyPips, FXStreet) — no signal reviews at all</li>
      <li><strong>Broker comparisons</strong> (EarnForex, ForexBrokerz) — broker-focused</li>
    </ul>
    <p>No site specifically reviews, compares, and verifies <strong>AI-powered forex signals and trading strategies</strong>. We fill that gap.</p>

    <h2>What We Review</h2>
    <ul>
      <li><strong>AI Signal Providers</strong> — Telegram bots, algorithmic services, AI trading platforms</li>
      <li><strong>Trading Strategies</strong> — ML-based, deep learning, reinforcement learning approaches</li>
      <li><strong>Prop Firms</strong> — Funded trading programs compatible with AI tools</li>
      <li><strong>Brokers</strong> — Platforms optimized for algorithmic and AI trading</li>
      <li><strong>AI Trading Tools</strong> — Chart pattern recognition, sentiment analysis, automated analysis</li>
    </ul>

    <h2>Our Team</h2>
